        "Evaluate f'(0) = 4 to show a = 4",
        "Differentiate again to find f''(x) = 20(1-x)^(-6)",
        "Evaluate f''(0) = 20",
        "Use Maclaurin formula: coefficient of x^2 is f''(0)/2! = 10, so b = 10"
      ],
